<title>USA: Centex Construction expands repurchase plan.</title>
<headline>Centex Construction expands repurchase plan.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS, Texas 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Centex Construction Products Inc said on Wednesday that its directors had approved a plan to raise by one million the number of shares available in the company's repurchase program.</p>
<p>The construction products company said the share hike brings the total number of shares currently available for repurchase to 1.763 million.</p>
